Vendored third-party material
=============================

R/colors.R contains colour-palette definitions copied from the `ltc` package
(ltc-color-palettes), reformatted but numerically unchanged. bulkiRNA declares
no dependency on `ltc`; the values are vendored so that a colour default is
plain, greppable source.

Upstream: https://github.com/loukesio/ltc-color-palettes

